    </p>
  </div>

  <p>
    Salesforce offers several integration methods, including REST and SOAP APIs for data exchange, Outbound Messaging 
    for event-driven updates, and the Salesforce Connect feature for accessing external data without replication. 
    Additionally, Salesforce AppExchange provides pre-built connectors and extensions for popular ERP systems, 
    reducing the complexity and time required for integration.
  </p>

  <p>
    A well-executed Salesforce-ERP integration helps companies enhance visibility across departments. Sales teams 
    can instantly view order status, inventory levels, and customer invoices, while finance teams can track 
    revenue and forecast sales accurately. This unified data flow improves decision-making and customer satisfaction.
  </p>

